      "status": "accepted",
      "explanation": "Eliminates temporary vector and string allocations and avoids costly substr calls by generating characters on\u2011the\u2011fly and using a sliding 4\u2011char window to count \"abcd\" occurrences. This reduces memory traffic and per\u2011iteration work from O(4) substring comparisons to O(1) character checks, preserving exact results for all inputs.",
